         (18, "Close-up — he reads a specific passage: locations of the Four Palace Vaults — massive vaults built beneath the imperial city, sealed with blood locks. His face: pale with realization. We see in his eyes: flash of the vault beneath THIS VERY BUILDING. He looks down at the floor. Camera: close-up on his face as realization hits, then point-of-view looking down at the floor. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — face realizing vault is beneath this building, point of view down at floor, 6s",
          "One vault was beneath this archive. He could feel it — a cold hum rising from the stones below. And something inside it was CALLING him. Calling him by name.",
          "Floor humming, his heartbeat, cold air rising, vault calling, whispered name"),
         (24, "Wide cinematic — the floor beneath him CRACKS. Glowing seal lines spread across the stone in the shape of a vast formation. The archive shakes. Ancient guardian figures — humanoid stone statues — begin to move in the shadows. He stands at the center of the cracking formation, the skin scroll in hand. Camera: wide, floor cracking into glowing formation, guardians awakening, him at the center. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — floor cracking into glowing formation, stone guardians awakening, him at the cracked center, 6s",
          "He had broken the seal. The archive had let him in — because it needed someone to take the scroll to the vaults. He was not a thief. He was a key. And the vaults were opening whether he wanted them to or not.",
          "Stone cracking, formation lighting up, guardian stone grinding, archive shaking, epic orchestral")
