     "Muc Than Ky Tập 18: Cuộn Ngày Mới | Xianxia Việt Sub ⚔️🖌️",
     "Episode 18 of Muc Than Ky. He writes on the legendary Scroll of Beginning — which has waited ten thousand years for someone to write on it. He writes 'tomorrow' — not as prophecy, but as creation. A thousand possible futures pour from a single character. Tomorrow becomes a promise, not a prediction.\n\n🖌️ Muc Than Ky — Original Chinese Fantasy Series\n📌 Follow for Episode 19 — The Ink Master's Betrayal\n#xianxia #muc than ky #scroll of beginnings #hope #tomorrow created #epic",
